### Step 1: Detect Possible Straights

Reasoning: A Straight is identified when the five cards have consecutive ranks, with no gaps. To detect this, computing the range between the highest and lowest rank and ensuring all ranks in the hand are unique is critical.

1. <rank_range><subtract><max(V2,V4,V6,V8,V10)><min(V2,V4,V6,V8,V10)><Range_between_highest_and_lowest_rank_among_all_cards>
